WEBVTT

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:06.020
Toys. They are miraculous buds that swell from the hearts of the chosen.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:12.490
Some flowers are born pure, while others bloom laced with poison.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.400
The Age of Detectives.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.660
The two flowers, vying for beauty.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:24.460
Their names are the Detective and the Phantom Thief.

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:07.310
A great test! A great test!

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:10.900
"Your Toys shall return after a great test!"

00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:13.440
I can't wait!

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:16.940
Yeah! Milky Holmes will finally be fully revived!

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:21.490
Our headache of expulsion'll will be gone!
And we'll be able to go back to our own rooms!

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.580
But what could this "great test" be?

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:27.200
HEY!

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:29.300
Look at me!!

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:32.850
Well then, I'm letting you know now that there's an exam happening next week!

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:34.800
Exam?

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:35.980
Test!

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:36.960
That's it!

00:02:37.810 --> 00:02:38.930
What is?

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:42.050
Feast your eyes on this!

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:50.020
<i>Milky Holmes...</i>

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:57.920
Sonia-chan!

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.870
We did it!

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:14.000
<i>She's been hiding that much power this whole time...</i>

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:24.260
W-We're sorry, Henriette-san!

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:26.910
Henriette-san?

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:28.470
Milky Holmes.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:32.440
I expect great results from your exam.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:35.190
Yes!

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:37.940
Please leave this great exam to us!

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:40.400
Are you all going to study now?

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.130
The department cave!

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:43.190
Department cave?

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:45.100
Yes, the department cave!

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:46.210
Department cave...

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:47.530
A department store basement!

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:48.400
I know.

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:53.500
If we don't hurry, the food sampling corner will close!!

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:54.330
Oh no!

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:57.330
Ah, I'll go and study in my room, so―

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:58.290
Let's go!

00:03:58.710 --> 00:03:59.570
C'mon, c'mon!

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:03.480
It's a gathering! A gathering! Gathering! Gathering! Gathering!!

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:07.650
We gathered a lot!

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:09.620
And, and...!

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.140
Look at this, everyone!

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:12.360
Tada!

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.290
Yokohama Department Store's Important Product Exhibition, starting tomorrow?

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:16.940
If we come, we'll be able to get a lot!

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:18.440
Awesome!

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.520
I'll be able to get tons of meat!

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:22.340
I wanna eat fish paste cake!

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:24.160
Um...

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:26.190
It's wonderful!

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:28.950
We should study...

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:30.440
What about you, Herc?

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:35.060
What do you want?

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.630
Yokohama Important Products Exhibition!

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:42.750
First day!

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:45.610
Gathering! Gathering! Gathering! Gathering!

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:46.900
Aren't you gonna study?

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:48.440
It's fine, it's fine!

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:50.440
Second day!

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:53.460
Gathering! Gathering! Gathering! Gathering!

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:54.480
Studying?

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.180
It's fine, it's fine!

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:58.180
Third day!

00:04:58.180 --> 00:05:01.080
Gathering! Gathering! Gathering! Gathering!

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:02.190
Look at me!

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:04.000
It's fine, it's fine!

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.150
No!!

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:10.910
This is the best!

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:12.950
Henriette-sama!

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:16.280
They're carelessly goofing off this week before the exam!

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:19.100
Even though failing this next exam means expulsion for them...

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:21.620
"It's fine, it's fine!" ...they say.

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:25.090
Sherlock's Toys was amazing that night when we saw it, but still...

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:30.080
Henriette-sama, if they somehow completely get their Toys back...

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:32.120
Is there a problem?

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:35.880
Ahh, that composed smile...

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:37.610
It's so her!

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:39.640
Don't get distracted. Get back to folding.

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:41.260
I wasn't distracted!!

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:44.230
Even if they were to get back their Toys,

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:46.990
I would not permit them to lay a finger on Henriette-sama.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.790
We're here for that very purpose.

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:54.700
That's right. Ever since that day...

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.910
Yes, ever since that day...

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:11.160
So this is the national treasure, Pleiades Diamonds...

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:12.140
It's quite heavy.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:19.020
Beautiful things should be in the possession of my beautiful self.

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.560
Don't you agree?

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.000
It's you again!

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:32.780
I'm falling!

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.700
How were my flames?

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:40.920
Jeez, it's unfair of you to leave me out. C'mon!

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:44.290
Stone River! Burning my rope is cheating!

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:45.730
Eh? That was me...

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:48.010
I've been thinking that I'd have to settle the score with you someday.

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:50.310
We do get along well. *kiss*

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:51.840
I'll end you in a minute.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.430
We do get along well! *kiss*

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:55.860
What, you were here?

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:57.430
Y-You bastards!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:02.100
Only one phantom thief is needed for this city, and that shall be beautiful I!

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.480
Fool! It is me!

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.320
Me, me, me!!

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:18.730
Where is this...?

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.130
I-Impossible!

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:30.550
How could I...?!

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:40.350
Beautiful... To think that there existed something this beautiful, except me...

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:46.860
W-Who are you...?

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:53.530
Smells good...

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.830
You are... You are my goddess!

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:04.790
Soft... smells so good...

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:11.260
Have you cooled down?

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.220
It's gone...

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.710
W-Was that...

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:17.690
...Toys of Resplendence?

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:19.880
You are weak.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:21.140
Weak?

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:24.430
Hunger, thirst, desire...

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:26.350
There is an overwhelming amount of things we pine for.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:32.190
If you wish to commit yourselves as phantom thieves,
then duel not with power, but with beauty and intelligence.

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.950
You are all just greenhorns acting blindly.

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:38.920
The jewels you steal are in misery.

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:39.910
Be more reserved.

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:42.710
We're going to get back your pride.

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:44.790
Y-You are...

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.710
Phantom Thief Arsène.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:52.630
We swore our loyalty to Henriette-sama,

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:54.720
to protect her,

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:57.480
and to be her ally.

00:08:57.480 --> 00:08:59.890
We are knights united to her cause!

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:04.610
That's...

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:06.900
That's my bolster cover!!

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:09.710
Oh, I think it got dirty.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:11.400
It was dirty!

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:15.790
R-Really?

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:17.030
Sorry, my bad.

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:22.300
I haven't washed him yet! I wanted to be the first to carefully and tenderly wash him!!

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:26.290
You stole Beautiful Me's first washing!!

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.650
Sorry...

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:29.000
That's disgusting...

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:33.670
Was it scary? Was it painful? You must've been screaming for beautiful me to save you!

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:37.130
You must've been crying out in pain from his violent washing!!

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:38.670
Hey, I said sorry!

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:40.160
Stop it, you two!

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:42.370
How could you understand my feelings?!

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:43.820
You're persistent!

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:45.230
Hey, I said stop it!

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:48.480
Because of Ishinagare... Because of Ishinagare...!!

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.220
Bastard!

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:51.070
Hey, stop it! And don't ignore me!!

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:53.020
YOU'RE DEAD!

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:54.860
UNFORGIVABLE!!

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.070
DON'T IGNORE ME!!!

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:00.120
What could that be?

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:01.670
Someone's Toys going berserk?

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:03.660
Lame!

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:08.710
Cheers!

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:10.400
Yay!

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:14.160
Tomorrow's finally the exam day, or this "great test," so to speak!

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:16.300
Our Toys will finally come back to us!

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:18.620
What're you doing, Herc?

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:20.040
If I don't study...

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:21.340
Switch... eroo!

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:23.740
Cheers!

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:25.680
Cheers!!

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:26.750
S-Study...

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:28.040
Cheers!

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:29.440
Ch-Cheers...

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:30.810
Yay!

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:35.570
We'll have to say goodbye to this attic too, eh.

00:10:36.090 --> 00:10:38.410
It's cramped, with a single bed that barely fits four!

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:41.630
This room is also terrible for its humidity!

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:46.610
But being with everyone was really fun for me.

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:51.250
What are you saying? Even if we return to our own rooms, we'll always be together!

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:54.590
See, even Kamaboko says so!

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:57.760
Yes...

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:00.840
Milky Holmes...

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:03.930
By tomorrow, for sure...

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:08.610
Our great test is here!

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:09.590
We'll be fine!

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:10.430
It'll be fine!

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:11.510
Everything'll be fine!

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:14.480
No problem!

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:21.540
Well then, we'll be starting the exam.
Students that are called are to come forward.

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:22.660
An exam!

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:24.080
Sherlock Shellingford.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:25.450
Ah, here!

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:28.540
The first problem is this.

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:29.430
Box.

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:30.450
Box?

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:32.840
There is a problem inside this box.

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:34.880
Use your Toys to get it out, and then solve it.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:36.220
Let's try.

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:36.970
Yessir!

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:41.220
<i>Now, my Toys... please come back!</i>

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:42.810
Yes, thank you.

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:44.110
I did it!

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:46.230
Wait... what?!

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:47.560
Sherlock Shellingford...

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:48.390
Failed!

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:52.970
Here is the next problem.

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:55.400
Please move this African elephant with your Toys.

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:03.980
Hercule Barton...

00:12:03.980 --> 00:12:04.820
Failed!

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:06.980
No!

00:12:07.650 --> 00:12:09.090
Moving on to the next problem.

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:11.120
Our special guest is Nijuuri-sensei!

00:12:12.180 --> 00:12:15.000
Now, if you have your Toys of Sense,

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:17.250
you should be able to see the problem written on here.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:21.160
Now, answer me! What can you see on my pink flower petal?!

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:24.300
Yes, look at me with those lovely eyes as close as you can...

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:27.260
Look!!

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:31.880
Cordelia Glauca...

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:32.890
Failed!

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:39.610
Please hurry and disable the switch, or otherwise the problem shall explode!

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:40.440
Wai-Wha...

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:41.940
Aww man!

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:44.120
C'mon, c'mon, c'mon, c'mon, c'mon, c'mon, c'mon―

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:46.770
Yuzurisaki Nero...

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:47.570
Failed!

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.230
And lastly, a group problem!

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:54.330
The bowling time you've all been waiting for!

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:56.910
Our guest is Nijuuri-sensei, once again!

00:12:56.910 --> 00:13:00.300
Show me your Toys and your teamwork!

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.290
What'll we do?! Our Toys haven't come back yet!

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:08.080
It's fine! Even if it doesn't work alone, if we could just combine our powers...!

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:09.070
Everyone?

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:10.610
Yes, everyone!

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:11.380
Everyone―

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:13.110
Strike!

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:13.720
Everyone―

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.360
Strike!

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:16.190
Everyone―

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:17.950
Strike!

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:20.480
Milky Holmes has failed!

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:44.800
"Your Toys shall return after a great test" my ass!

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:47.290
Didn't we all fail?!

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:49.090
If we get expelled...

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.480
Ahh, jeez!

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:54.870
Damn...

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:57.570
That's why I said we should study...

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:58.510
No you didn't.

00:13:58.510 --> 00:14:00.590
But I said it so many times―

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:04.290
We weren't listening! Why didn't you say it more clearly, Herc?

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:06.740
P-Please stop this!

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:15.380
And now, a special report.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:19.770
Phantom Thief Arsène has appeared at the annex of Yokohama Museum.

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:29.130
Now, come at me, detectives of Milky Holmes.

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:33.600
I shall prepare a trial that determines whether you get expelled or not.

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:36.220
Is this...

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:38.030
Ah, I understand now!

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:40.350
This is it! This is really it!

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:42.350
Which?

00:14:42.350 --> 00:14:45.060
I've made a really big misunderstanding!

00:14:45.060 --> 00:14:45.920
What?

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:47.320
A great "test!"

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:50.500
What're you talking about? The test already ended!

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:53.420
That's not it! What we did was an "exam!"

00:14:54.430 --> 00:14:55.580
That was an exam.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:57.540
The test is this!!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.910
I-I see! That was an exam!

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:02.850
This is the test!!

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:05.210
Milky Holmes, dispatch!

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:06.870
We've completed the blockade!

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:08.510
Good, don't let even an ant through!

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:09.700
Kokoro-chan!

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:11.380
Found four ants! Seize them!

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:12.450
Kokoro-chan―

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:14.430
Kokoro-chan...

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:16.310
Don't call me that! Go home!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:19.300
Please! Let us in!

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:23.590
I refuse! Just what good could you Toysless losers accomplish?!

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:27.860
It's fine! Our Toys will come back by tonight!

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:28.990
Huh?

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:30.660
You're spouting off nonsense again...

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:34.030
It's the one thing we'll ask of you! Ever!

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.120
Ahh, this brings me back...

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:41.290
At that time we were so engrossed with Arsène-sama that this was left behind.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:42.730
By Stone River, of course.

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:43.480
It was you.

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:45.540
Shut up, you retard!

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:50.190
Arsène-sama is waiting. Let's finish this―

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:51.170
Whip!

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:52.290
What are you doing?!

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:53.000
Twenty!

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:56.910
I'll be the one to deliver this to Arsène-sama, alright?

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:57.890
What was that?

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.680
And now, while they're not looking―

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:02.170
The hell are you doing?!

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:04.710
I really should've settled the score with you back then.

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:05.900
Hey! Don't ignore me!

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:10.280
Arsène-sama only needs one manservant. Which is beautiful me!

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:12.450
You jest! It is me!

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:13.910
It's me!!

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:16.120
You're dead!!

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:21.050
Milky Holmes has arrived!

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:22.790
That's as far as you go, Phantom Thief Arsène!

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:28.470
Milky Holmes has arrived!

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:33.000
It's so weird that we've been able to stay together for this long!

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:34.620
Don't make me repeat myself.

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:41.280
I don't want to hear that from you, Rat! Especially when <i>you're</i> the one slobbering all over Arsène-sama!

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:43.500
Milky Holmes has arrived!!

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:45.040
What now, a quarrel?

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:46.230
That's discouraging...

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:53.030
I'd like to pledge my power and my life to the beauty of Arsène-sama, be it through hell or high water―

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:55.150
We've arrived!!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:58.420
You'll never be able to escape from this absolute rear naked choke!

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:03.410
I'm the only one that Arsène-sama tucked so kindly and carefully between her boobs!

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:06.960
Oh? Must've felt nice for you to be able to start talking that way―

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.430
Milky Holmes has arrived!!

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:10.230
It's a quarrel.

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:11.210
They're really going at it.

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:12.450
Eat this!

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:15.220
Missiles?!

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:17.930
I am Arsene-sama's mysterious gecko!

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:21.970
I'll cut down anyone who stands in Arsene-sama's way... as her beautiful praying mantis!

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:22.970
Praying~

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:24.400
Who gives a shit?!

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:25.090
You bastard!

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:27.020
Please stop it!

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:31.260
Please don't do something as sad as fighting!

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:33.710
That's like what we're doing...

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:35.530
The heck are you saying? This is our chance!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:38.150
Chance for what?

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:41.030
They're behaving weird!

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:41.980
What'd you say?

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:46.400
If you just realized it, then it's already too late!

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:50.080
You now have no chances of winning now that we've taken this formation!

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.950
Ah, we're being surrounded!

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:53.130
And isn't this...

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:54.670
Isn't this...

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:56.840
...a tetrahedron?!

00:17:56.840 --> 00:18:00.720
How will you break this tetrahedron without your Toys?

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:02.690
Please leave it to me!

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:05.680
Fall... Please fall!

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:08.850
Come to me, my Toys!

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.610
Toys, please!

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.510
Crouching Tiger, Hidden Dragon!

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:18.490
Sherlock!!

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:20.450
If I can break this wall...

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:25.030
Herc-san! Your Toys should definitely come back!

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:27.410
<i>Come back to me, my Toys!</i>

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.670
Hey! I'm not standing out!

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:30.210
What?

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:31.290
Switch with me!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.200
Herc!

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:35.110
Quarrel?

00:18:35.110 --> 00:18:35.910
Now's our chance!

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:41.630
If I can get my Toys to access the entire building system here...!

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:42.430
Nero!

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:43.510
Nero!!

00:18:46.590 --> 00:18:49.060
Our Toys aren't coming back!

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:52.440
I'm...

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:57.240
Cordelia-san!

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:58.950
DARK!!

00:18:59.550 --> 00:19:05.950
Cordelia-san! It's fine! Even if it's pitch black, you can still use your Toys of Sense! Right?

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:09.080
My Toys...

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:12.840
No way...

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:16.630
What's wrong, Milky Holmes?

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:18.520
Are you finished already, Milky Holmes?

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:20.930
Is that all you've got, Milky Holmes?

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:23.300
Everyone, don't give up!

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.300
If we combine our powers together...!

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:29.810
Please!

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:33.600
Die! Rat Fire!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:38.900
I-If you want to blow things up, then I've got one here too! The same one used at Nero's exam!

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:44.590
Are you insane?!

00:19:44.590 --> 00:19:46.450
Huh? What should I do?

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:49.160
We're outta here!!

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:52.580
Hey! What're you all doing?!

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:53.910
Kokoro-chan!

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:58.090
New G-Type Shield, expand!

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:07.720
...has appeared once again. In Yokohama Museum, an explosion has...

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:13.410
Kokoro-chan!

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:15.490
Kokoro-chan!!

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:16.060
Kokoro―

00:20:17.420 --> 00:20:18.420
Kokoro-chan?

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:19.370
Such a pain...

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:22.450
You're a pain in the ass! Get the hell outta my crime scene!!

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.560
It was Rat's fault that the duel went up in smoke.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:34.800
Shut up! You ran away too, didn't you?

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:37.110
Well, I'm the best, anyways.

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:37.860
I am!

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:38.730
I am.

00:20:38.730 --> 00:20:41.300
Me! Me! Me! Me!

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:43.930
Arsène-sama...?

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:07.620
It's raining cats and dogs, isn't it? Isn't it?

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:12.360
I'm getting hungry! We have to grill some potatoes!

00:21:12.360 --> 00:21:14.670
Or would you like mushrooms instead?

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:18.320
Let's all take a bath!

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:24.050
Our room has...!

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:27.980
Henriette-san?!

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:35.560
No... No way...

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:39.270
Milky Holmes. You are hereby expelled.

00:23:18.090 --> 00:23:20.500
Milky Holmes got expelled, apparently.

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:21.550
Huh? Serves them right!

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:23.510
You might say that, but aren't you actually worried?

00:23:23.510 --> 00:23:29.330
W-Who would?! My brain, with an IQ of 130 billion, wouldn't spend any time on such a futile activity!

00:23:29.330 --> 00:23:31.640
Something's wrong with your head if you've gotten to the point of saying 130 billion.

00:23:31.640 --> 00:23:34.260
Everyone, Arsène and the Phantom Thief Empire has appeared!

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:35.070
Time to dispatch!

00:23:35.070 --> 00:23:41.300
Only the beautiful genius girl Kokoro and the rest of G4 shall protect Yokohama's peace while Milky Holmes is crying their heads off!

00:23:41.300 --> 00:23:43.860
Next time: The Grand Yokohama Canyon of Fear!

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:45.280
The culprit is G4!

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:47.730
It's Arsène!!
